      "note": "At connect/v0.4 a union maps only at a connector's own return type, so the union needs one extra request per order, and reconcile and source coverage then read payment as unmapped on all four Order operations and the re-fetch as an undeclared relationship field. The object keeps every field the API sends (D-a39c6a: expose last4, brand and iban), typed; type tells the caller which fields apply. Replaces finding F-lr3c96. Reopen to choose the union.",
      "decision": "Lumen_Books_Order.payment is Lumen_Books_Payment {type: Lumen_Books_PaymentType (card|bank), last4, brand, iban}, mapped inline as payment { type last4 brand iban }.",
      "by": "agent",
      "at": "2026-10-21"
    }
